                     "publication_date":  "2017-12-28",
                     "description":  "A massive figure of Amitabha Buddha standing on a lotus base, made of white marble, with traces of gilding and pigments and a visible joint at the Buddha\u0027s waist. Two hands are missing but the wooden dowels and iron brackets installed at the end of arms to hold the hands remain. Inscribed and dated.\n\nNot perfect yet.\n\nSource: Objaverse 1.0 / Sketchfab",
